<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Results of Philippine pro league.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Results of Philippine pro league.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Friday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Sta Lucia Realty beat Mobiline 98-96 (35-47)</p>
<p>San Miguel Beer beat Ginebra 109-107 (55-51)</p>
